WEBVTT

00:07.380 --> 00:08.840
Have you heard the news?

00:08.840 --> 00:13.260
A mere monkey killed Viscount Shadow
right after Baron Falco!

00:13.260 --> 00:15.260
Losing to a monkey?

00:15.260 --> 00:16.010
Yeah.

00:16.010 --> 00:18.350
So much for the Five Noble Clans.

00:18.350 --> 00:22.020
They probably aren't even
as good as they claim...

00:26.980 --> 00:29.190
Pipe it, ya pipsqueaks.

00:29.780 --> 00:34.660
Nothing pisses me off more than
y'all pompous little pipsqueaks.

00:34.660 --> 00:36.410
I-It can't be...

00:36.410 --> 00:40.290
Duke Ioana,
the Head of the Five Noble Clans!

00:40.290 --> 00:42.540
F-Forgive my rudeness!

00:45.000 --> 00:47.830
This toy hasn't been
working properly lately, you see.

00:49.040 --> 00:53.260
Oh, how about you
become my new toy?

00:57.300 --> 00:58.850
Nah, never mind.

00:58.850 --> 01:00.850
You'd shed a lot.

01:00.850 --> 01:02.350
There'd be fur everywhere.

01:05.270 --> 01:06.600
What are you doing?

01:06.600 --> 01:09.980
How about you hurry up
and get rid of that filth?

01:09.980 --> 01:11.480
Y-Yes, ma'am!

01:11.480 --> 01:12.780
Good grief.

01:12.780 --> 01:15.110
I can't stand these small fries.

01:19.120 --> 01:24.080
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:24.080 --> 01:28.880
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

01:28.880 --> 01:38.680
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

01:38.680 --> 01:43.430
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

01:43.430 --> 01:47.310
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

01:48.690 --> 01:52.610
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

01:52.610 --> 01:55.820
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

01:57.240 --> 02:01.990
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

02:01.990 --> 02:06.660
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

02:06.660 --> 02:08.920
♪See the world through my eyes♪

02:08.920 --> 02:11.250
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

02:11.250 --> 02:16.760
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

02:17.970 --> 02:22.350
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

02:22.800 --> 02:27.480
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

02:27.480 --> 02:32.360
♪Because you have given it to me♪

02:32.360 --> 02:39.150
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

02:53.920 --> 02:56.000
I know you won't disappoint me, Ein.

02:56.000 --> 02:59.760
It'd be a shame if you can't
beat the likes of Shadow.

03:00.510 --> 03:02.260
What have you been doing?

03:02.260 --> 03:04.050
Oh my, Ioana.

03:04.050 --> 03:09.060
Well, you seem quite infatuated
with that Ein guy, Lady Echidna.

03:09.060 --> 03:13.690
Why wouldn't I?
He has special eyes with him.

03:13.690 --> 03:16.820
Doesn't change the fact
that he's a mere monkey.

03:17.130 --> 03:19.070
Are you sure about that?

03:19.070 --> 03:22.160
Would something so ordinary
beat both Falco and Shadow?

03:22.160 --> 03:25.240
A beginner's luck won't explain that.
He's got skills.

03:27.580 --> 03:29.790
Guess I'll just have to
see it for myself.

03:31.370 --> 03:33.790
Then I have a favor to ask you.

03:33.790 --> 03:37.170
Why me? Can't you just ask
the small fries?

03:38.510 --> 03:42.050
I need you to abduct one
of Yggdrasil's spirits.

03:42.380 --> 03:44.550
You're meeting Ein anyway.

03:44.550 --> 03:48.900
His goal is to meet Yggdrasil's spirits.

03:48.900 --> 03:50.680
You can set up an ambush.

03:50.680 --> 03:54.560
Yggdrasil? That source of all mana?

03:54.560 --> 03:57.570
Oh? Are you taking an interest in it?

03:57.910 --> 03:59.190
I guess so.

03:59.590 --> 04:01.740
I got your order, Lady Echidna.

04:01.740 --> 04:06.580
I'll kill Ein and bring you the spirit.

04:06.580 --> 04:08.870
Confident, aren't you?

04:09.750 --> 04:11.710
I'm an elite, after all.

04:12.210 --> 04:12.910
Hey!

04:14.620 --> 04:15.790
Move it.

04:16.710 --> 04:17.960
You deaf or what?

04:19.590 --> 04:20.380
Huh?

04:21.130 --> 04:22.470
He's dead.

04:23.050 --> 04:24.060
Oh, well.

04:24.590 --> 04:26.760
Sorry to bother you, but...

04:26.760 --> 04:28.220
Toss this trash out, will you?

04:29.890 --> 04:31.350
How amusing.

04:31.980 --> 04:36.100
Come on, you little one.
You can't afford to rest.

04:36.610 --> 04:41.280
You have to work harder
and become stronger.

04:42.610 --> 04:44.910
By the way, Ein.

04:44.910 --> 04:47.660
What do you want for lunch?

04:47.660 --> 04:50.910
Huh? You're cooking today, Yuri?

04:51.140 --> 04:52.140
Yes!

04:54.790 --> 04:55.800
Come in.

04:57.290 --> 04:59.540
Alice? What's wrong?

05:00.630 --> 05:04.550
Ein, can I talk to you
for a moment?

05:04.550 --> 05:07.220
Sure. Why don't you come in...

05:07.220 --> 05:09.550
Sounds like a confession is happening!

05:09.550 --> 05:11.830
What's that?
That sounds like fun!

05:11.830 --> 05:13.810
I want to join too!

05:14.810 --> 05:16.810
Yuri? Pina?

05:17.080 --> 05:18.220
It's not that.

05:19.940 --> 05:23.440
It's a serious matter about our sisters.

05:24.490 --> 05:28.740
I've been using my Thousand-Mile Eye
to search for Yggdrasil for a while now.

05:29.320 --> 05:31.580
I wanted to meet them
as much as everyone.

05:32.740 --> 05:33.700
Also...

05:36.000 --> 05:40.380
I wanted to be of use to you
even just a little, Ein.

05:41.210 --> 05:42.710
Alice!

05:42.710 --> 05:46.420
Nothing beats that earnestness of yours.

05:46.420 --> 05:48.470
You're amazing, Big Sis Alice.

05:48.470 --> 05:50.720
Have you found one, by any chance?

05:50.720 --> 05:54.810
Not exactly.
I was led to find it.

05:55.600 --> 05:58.100
What do you mean?

05:58.100 --> 06:00.860
Like, I don't exactly follow.

06:00.860 --> 06:03.480
Let's just be on our way to see them!

06:03.480 --> 06:05.740
Big sis agrees!

06:07.490 --> 06:11.990
Wait, did a stranger just jump in?

06:11.990 --> 06:13.830
Really?

06:13.830 --> 06:15.500
You're probably imagining it.

06:18.500 --> 06:20.750
She's right.

06:25.050 --> 06:27.760
Who the heck are you?!

06:28.550 --> 06:31.390
Oh my, you found me.

06:32.010 --> 06:34.390
Come to me, my sisters!

06:34.390 --> 06:36.890
Big sis!

06:40.440 --> 06:45.440
Right, I forgot!
This isn't the real me.

06:47.280 --> 06:50.030
Aww, Big Sis Kursh.

06:50.030 --> 06:52.070
"Big Sis Kursh"?

06:52.070 --> 06:55.410
Yep. She's our second eldest sister.

06:55.410 --> 06:59.000
Hiya. I'm Kursh.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.920
Nice to meet you.

07:00.920 --> 07:04.040
A spirit just appeared on her own?!

07:04.670 --> 07:08.510
I'm Ein. I'm working with Yuri.

07:08.510 --> 07:11.010
Nice meeting you too, Miss Kursh.

07:11.930 --> 07:15.260
Just Kursh is fine, really.
No need to be so stiff.

07:15.260 --> 07:18.310
Aren't we friends already, Einsy?

07:18.310 --> 07:19.640
Einsy?

07:21.520 --> 07:24.310
I can't possibly do that.
We just met.

07:24.310 --> 07:26.110
I suppose that's true!

07:28.320 --> 07:34.070
Yggdrasil's spirits really are full of
quirky, eccentric personalities...

07:37.330 --> 07:39.330
Back to the main topic.

07:39.330 --> 07:42.080
Ah, you're right.

07:42.080 --> 07:46.040
So, a demon is currently
targeting Yggdrasil.

07:46.040 --> 07:49.590
I'd like Einsy's help on that.

07:49.590 --> 07:50.970
A demon?

07:50.970 --> 07:55.720
We managed to hold them off somehow
but they're stronger than we expected.

07:56.260 --> 07:58.680
Got it. I'll go there right away.

07:58.680 --> 08:00.350
Where is your Yggdrasil?

08:00.350 --> 08:02.440
Ah, you've got it wrong.

08:02.440 --> 08:05.360
They're not after my Yggdrasil.

08:05.360 --> 08:08.860
They're after May's Yggdrasil.

08:09.990 --> 08:11.030
May?

08:11.030 --> 08:13.740
Yes. She's our youngest sister.

08:13.740 --> 08:15.490
A very cute girl.

08:16.240 --> 08:19.370
When I was searching Abyss Wood
with the Thousand-Mile Eye,

08:19.370 --> 08:21.200
I found May's Yggdrasil.

08:26.790 --> 08:30.420
The entire area seems to be
a vast hidden dungeon.

08:31.840 --> 08:33.010
I see.

08:33.590 --> 08:37.350
I assume May's guardian
is currently striving to hold the line?

08:37.350 --> 08:42.560
Not exactly. She was killed
a long time ago.

08:42.560 --> 08:44.600
What? How?

08:44.600 --> 08:48.110
Yggdrasil is a precious
source of mana.

08:48.110 --> 08:51.110
Many would try to steal it
even if it means some killing.

08:55.110 --> 09:02.870
And that's why I'm acting
as both a spirit and May's guardian.

09:02.870 --> 09:06.880
But you can't leave
your own Yggdrasil, right?

09:08.000 --> 09:10.550
Among the top three high-ranking spirits,

09:10.550 --> 09:14.920
the eldest, second, and third daughters
possess the Independent Action skill,

09:14.920 --> 09:17.890
allowing them to move
around freely to some extent.

09:17.890 --> 09:23.220
I see. Kursh has been
protecting May until now.

09:23.220 --> 09:27.520
Until a demon attacked,
trying to take her away?

09:27.520 --> 09:32.900
As expected from Yuri's fiancé,
you catch on fast.

09:35.400 --> 09:39.490
Huh? Did she just casually throw
a concerning statement?

09:40.280 --> 09:45.620
What you're seeing right now
is merely a projection.

09:45.620 --> 09:48.920
My actual self is still
protecting May at her place.

09:48.920 --> 09:51.960
Though, I don't think this
projection will last any longer.

09:51.960 --> 09:53.300
I see.

09:53.800 --> 09:57.930
Is that demon so hard to defeat
even with your Evil Eye?

09:59.390 --> 10:02.470
Well, I could win if I went all out.

10:02.470 --> 10:07.390
But then I'd blow up May's Yggdrasil
along with Rayshik in its entirety.

10:07.390 --> 10:10.060
It's a hard one to control.

10:10.060 --> 10:14.730
Is that mask sealing
your Evil Eye, by any chance?

10:14.730 --> 10:16.950
Bingo!

10:17.490 --> 10:21.910
A demon so strong that even
Kursh would need to go all out.

10:21.910 --> 10:26.160
And I'm no longer the target
this time, rather, the spirits!

10:26.160 --> 10:27.750
I won't let that happen!

10:29.540 --> 10:32.130
All right, I know what we should do.

10:32.130 --> 10:34.250
We're helping Kursh and May.

10:34.880 --> 10:36.590
Is that okay?

10:36.590 --> 10:39.720
Yes! Let's save May!

10:39.720 --> 10:41.220
Of course!

10:41.220 --> 10:42.720
Understood.

10:43.640 --> 10:47.480
Kursh, I promise we'll
come get you both.

10:47.480 --> 10:50.230
So please, just hold on a little longer.

10:52.110 --> 10:55.980
I see. I understand why
my sisters like you so much.

10:57.070 --> 11:00.660
Alice knows where the Yggdrasil is.

11:00.660 --> 11:04.990
Then I'll be waiting for you,
Ein and the lovely sisters.

11:13.920 --> 11:17.260
So this entire forest is
actually a hidden dungeon?

11:18.010 --> 11:21.720
It seems to be the case.
There's a powerful curse upon it.

11:22.260 --> 11:27.640
It activates when being approached
from above, keeping anyone from leaving.

11:28.640 --> 11:33.440
The locals refer to that as
"being eaten by the forest."

11:36.400 --> 11:37.980
Still, though...

11:38.650 --> 11:43.030
Everywhere I look,
it's trees, trees, and trees.

11:43.030 --> 11:45.490
Where is even the right path?

11:45.490 --> 11:46.410
We'll be fine.

11:46.410 --> 11:50.210
Alice is pinpointing
the location of the Yggdrasil.

11:50.210 --> 11:55.170
With Thousand-Mile Eye and Appraisal
combined, we'll find our way.

11:55.170 --> 11:58.000
Oh, there it is!

11:58.000 --> 12:02.760
It's time for your Super
Smooth Monster-Slaying Time!

12:02.760 --> 12:04.680
What's that about?

12:04.680 --> 12:07.850
I witnessed this firsthand.

12:07.850 --> 12:12.970
You'd breeze through dungeons
no matter tough the traps

12:12.970 --> 12:15.230
and monster placements
that'd scare people.

12:15.230 --> 12:17.820
What a bummer...

12:18.570 --> 12:22.570
Though, I've seen no monsters so far.

12:22.570 --> 12:27.330
Yeah. Even though this forest is
said to be full of formidable monsters.

12:27.870 --> 12:29.910
That's precisely why.

12:29.910 --> 12:30.500
What?

12:30.500 --> 12:33.920
The monsters of this forest are no fools.

12:33.920 --> 12:38.170
They can see your strength so
they don't approach you carelessly.

12:38.170 --> 12:39.000
Well, then.

12:39.900 --> 12:41.260
All the more reason to hurry,

12:43.840 --> 12:45.260
Super Acceleration.

12:45.260 --> 12:48.930
You've grown stronger
after defeating demons.

12:48.930 --> 12:51.770
Did you notice any changes in your body?

12:51.770 --> 12:53.270
Changes?

12:53.270 --> 12:55.310
You will understand in time.

12:55.310 --> 12:57.740
Let's just proceed without
engaging in...

12:57.750 --> 12:59.230
No, wait! Halt at once!

12:59.950 --> 13:01.030
I know.

13:01.390 --> 13:02.350
It's coming.

13:08.070 --> 13:10.580
I've been waiting for you, Ein.

13:10.580 --> 13:15.040
I am Countess Hornet, the fifth rank
in Five Demon Nobles.

13:15.040 --> 13:18.630
Now, my beloved minions.

13:18.630 --> 13:21.920
Fight for me, and then...

13:21.920 --> 13:23.250
Die.

13:27.800 --> 13:30.930
Would you please stay
out of this, you small fry?

13:40.260 --> 13:44.820
It would be too hard even for him
to handle too many of us.

13:44.820 --> 13:48.450
Don't get cocky just because
you handled Falco and Shadow.

13:49.450 --> 13:50.700
It's not advised.

13:58.990 --> 14:00.540
And that's a wr...

14:01.040 --> 14:02.960
Huh? Where did he go?

14:07.590 --> 14:11.600
Sorry, my policy is to show
no mercy for demons.

14:11.600 --> 14:12.930
Oh?

14:18.600 --> 14:22.690
Too bad. I have the ability
Pheromone Commander.

14:22.690 --> 14:26.110
Which means I can control my minions
with my pheromones at will.

14:26.110 --> 14:30.110
Now, here's a question:
Can you find me among them?

14:30.120 --> 14:32.620
I don't care which one you are.

14:32.620 --> 14:34.000
I'll just wipe it all.

14:34.580 --> 14:35.540
Ursula.

14:35.540 --> 14:39.470
Got it. I've already locked onto
each of their critical points.

14:39.470 --> 14:40.830
Let's get it over with.

14:40.830 --> 14:41.880
Thanks a lot.

14:41.880 --> 14:44.630
Huh? No way you can do tha...

14:44.630 --> 14:45.960
Activate: Sure-Hit.

14:46.800 --> 14:48.510
Burning Bullet!

14:53.640 --> 14:56.640
What is this?

14:56.640 --> 14:59.230
Things will certainly go south,
at this point.

15:00.140 --> 15:02.020
For now, I'll just...

15:02.020 --> 15:03.980
Retreat!

15:05.020 --> 15:07.190
Huh? I wonder whose it is?

15:07.190 --> 15:10.150
Oh, well. Now I just
have to hide here.

15:12.870 --> 15:16.030
Hey, where do you think
you're running off to?

15:17.060 --> 15:19.000
La-Lady Ioana!

15:19.000 --> 15:21.920
Oh, uh...

15:21.920 --> 15:26.250
He's stronger than I anticipated.
I'm planning to get him next...

15:26.880 --> 15:30.550
As if I'd give a next chance
for a useless piece.

15:30.550 --> 15:31.760
What a joke.

15:34.890 --> 15:37.970
I'm so fed up with being
surrounded by idiots.

15:37.970 --> 15:40.310
That was the Countess of the five nobles?

15:40.310 --> 15:42.400
The world is ending sooner than I thought.

15:42.650 --> 15:46.650
Well, at least you led him
straight to me.

15:47.190 --> 15:48.990
Right, Ein?

15:51.200 --> 15:55.370
I am Duke Ioana, the fifth rank
of the Demon Noble.

15:55.370 --> 15:56.780
Nice to meet you.

15:57.410 --> 16:00.780
This must be the demon
Kursh mentioned.

16:00.790 --> 16:03.420
She's completely beyond
Hornet's level.

16:05.530 --> 16:09.130
So you can still sense my power
without Magic Detection

16:09.130 --> 16:10.710
despite my Magic Suppression?

16:10.720 --> 16:12.680
Not bad for a monkey.

16:14.680 --> 16:20.270
Normally, it isn't my job to
erase a lowly being like you are, but...

16:20.270 --> 16:25.690
I'm here to abduct a Yggdrasil's
spirit anyway, so might as well.

16:26.190 --> 16:30.690
You are after me and the spirits?!
You won't get away with this!

16:32.030 --> 16:34.450
And what will you do exactly?

16:34.450 --> 16:37.030
I'll destroy you. Level Drain.

16:37.950 --> 16:42.710
Cloning? I haven't even got the
chance to activate my debuffs.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.000
Adamantine Strength!

17:14.360 --> 17:16.700
Ouchie! Ouchie!

17:16.700 --> 17:21.790
It's been a while since someone
actually made me bleed!

17:23.870 --> 17:26.040
Looks like I can have some fun!

17:26.710 --> 17:28.710
Precision Shooting.

17:29.210 --> 17:31.730
Any defenses, even a parry,
will be nullified.

17:31.730 --> 17:34.470
Always homes in and hits the target.

17:34.470 --> 17:36.470
Goodbye, Ein.

17:37.470 --> 17:38.300
Parry!

17:40.230 --> 17:44.180
What was that? Precision Shooting
is supposed to nullify a parry.

17:45.730 --> 17:47.600
Oh, well. I'll just...

17:48.600 --> 17:51.570
Wait. Something's wrong!

17:51.570 --> 17:53.770
Not only my ability is handicapped,

17:53.770 --> 17:57.280
I also can't dodge attacks
I normally would.

17:57.860 --> 18:03.120
A single Level Drain
caused all this?!

18:12.960 --> 18:15.130
Huh? What?

18:15.130 --> 18:17.630
Still alive after
being beheaded, huh?

18:17.630 --> 18:20.760
Well, aren't you as stubborn
as cockroaches.

18:21.390 --> 18:23.180
I'll let you in on something.

18:23.810 --> 18:26.640
I didn't use Level Drain only once.

18:27.440 --> 18:30.270
When I hit you with
Adamantine Strength,

18:30.270 --> 18:33.190
there's Level Drain
in each of its hits.

18:33.190 --> 18:35.610
While I lost count of the hit,

18:37.650 --> 18:41.780
you're now weaker than
some random monster.

18:42.520 --> 18:45.080
Huh? What are you talking about?

18:46.000 --> 18:50.750
I'm an elite. I'm at the top
of the Five Noble Demons!

18:50.750 --> 18:53.540
I was born an elite!

18:55.050 --> 19:00.380
I'm a genius blessed with the power
only chosen demons possess.

19:00.380 --> 19:03.800
There's no way it should be
taken from me so easily...

19:03.800 --> 19:08.020
Not in this place,
by someone like you!

19:09.690 --> 19:14.690
I would have won weren't it for your
cowardly move like Level Drain!

19:14.690 --> 19:17.430
I'll kill you next time!

19:17.430 --> 19:19.240
I will!

19:19.240 --> 19:22.350
Just you wait, Ein!

19:22.350 --> 19:24.330
- You're not getting away!
- Leave her be!

19:24.330 --> 19:27.700
Ensuring Kursh and
May's safety comes first.

19:28.150 --> 19:30.710
You're right.
I understand.

19:32.330 --> 19:33.580
Ein.

19:33.580 --> 19:34.590
Alice?

19:34.590 --> 19:35.900
I'll lead the way.

19:35.900 --> 19:37.410
Please do.

19:41.220 --> 19:42.160
This one.

19:43.470 --> 19:45.970
Is this... a tree's cocoon?

19:46.510 --> 19:47.380
Yeah.

19:48.630 --> 19:50.970
Sister Kursh and May
are just ahead.

19:51.730 --> 19:56.860
Sure, it looks like a sturdy wall,
but isn't this a bit too conspicuous?

19:56.860 --> 19:59.490
You could really tell
it hides something vital.

20:00.650 --> 20:02.990
It's covered by the spirit's power,

20:02.990 --> 20:05.530
so normal people can't see it.

20:05.530 --> 20:08.990
I see. It's visible to me because
I have the Spirit's Eyes, huh?

20:08.990 --> 20:13.210
Even Ioana won't be able to see this.

20:13.210 --> 20:17.880
She could only sense its presence,
that's why she blindly shot her bullets.

20:18.630 --> 20:21.010
Well, how do we get insi...

20:21.380 --> 20:23.050
W-What?

20:24.990 --> 20:26.860
I've been waiting for you!

20:27.390 --> 20:29.600
Come on in!

20:29.600 --> 20:30.640
Thank you!

20:42.650 --> 20:44.280
Whoa!

20:44.280 --> 20:45.530
Whoo-hoo!

20:45.530 --> 20:46.910
So beautiful!

20:46.910 --> 20:49.790
Hello, my cute little sisters!

20:49.790 --> 20:52.410
I've missed you!

20:52.410 --> 20:54.670
Big sis!

20:54.670 --> 20:58.170
There, there.

20:58.170 --> 21:01.510
Hiya, Big Sis Kursh!
You doing well?

21:01.510 --> 21:04.350
Hi, Pina!
I'm doing just fine!

21:10.350 --> 21:11.930
Yay!

21:12.290 --> 21:13.500
What was that...

21:13.980 --> 21:16.560
A special greeting
between those two.

21:16.560 --> 21:20.320
They've had a similar vibe since way back,
so they oddly hit it off.

21:20.320 --> 21:22.090
Alice, you wanna join in?

21:22.090 --> 21:22.880
I'm fine.

21:22.880 --> 21:24.740
You're so stiff.

21:24.740 --> 21:30.030
I know you really want one
between you and your crush, right?

21:30.030 --> 21:31.200
Right?

21:32.660 --> 21:34.100
What are you talking about?

21:34.950 --> 21:37.530
I'm glad you're safe.

21:37.920 --> 21:39.960
But, where's May?

21:40.540 --> 21:42.630
She's napping over there.

21:47.340 --> 21:51.510
This girl is May?
Better not wake her up.

21:52.600 --> 21:54.600
Quietly now...

22:09.570 --> 22:14.910
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.910 --> 22:19.920
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.920 --> 22:22.340
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.340 --> 22:25.420
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.430 --> 22:30.390
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.390 --> 22:37.140
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.140 --> 22:42.020
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.020 --> 22:47.030
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.030 --> 22:51.820
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.120 --> 22:55.580
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.580 --> 22:57.040
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.040 --> 23:03.920
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.800 --> 23:11.220
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.220 --> 23:15.890
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.890 --> 23:18.560
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.560 --> 23:21.150
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.150 --> 23:26.070
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.070 --> 23:28.490
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.490 --> 23:31.030
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.030 --> 23:31.660
(Even Given)

23:31.660 --> 23:32.240
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.240 --> 23:32.450
(I'm)

23:32.450 --> 23:32.620
(Actually)

23:32.620 --> 23:32.740
(the Strongest)

23:35.830 --> 23:39.000
Next Episode: Happiness, Forever.

23:39.000 --> 23:41.000
(Next Episode: Happiness, Forever)
